    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02353-02354",
      "page_role": "narration",
      "speaker_en": null,
      "jp": "自警団を率いているカウラ……背に負った両手剣は\n良く使い込まれており、相当な実力が窺われる。",
      "en": "Kaura, who leads the city watch...\nThe two-handed sword on her back is well-worn, showing considerable skill."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02361-02362",
      "page_role": "narration",
      "speaker_en": null,
      "jp": "俺はカウラに勘違いさせた儘にして、\nラティナ王女の事を聞いてみる事にした。",
      "en": "I left Kaura to her misunderstanding and decided to ask about Princess Ratina."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02364-02365",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Kaura",
      "jp": "あの夜に裸で現れては男を襲っているって奴だろ",
      "en": "You mean the one who shows up naked at night and attacks men, right?"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02367-02369",
      "page_role": "narration",
      "speaker_en": null,
      "jp": "レヴィアからの報告には裸で、とまでは無かったが\n男の精気を吸い取っているのであればおかしくもないだろう。\n俺はカウラに向かって頷いて見せた。",
      "en": "Levia's report didn't mention nakedness, but if she's draining men's essence, it's not surprising. I nodded to Kaura."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02371-02372",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Kaura",
      "jp": "だけどあれは人間じゃないよ",
      "en": "But that ain't human."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02374-02375",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Celica",
      "jp": "？",
      "en": "?"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02377-02380",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Kaura",
      "jp": "うちの連中が夜の見回りの時に会った事があってね、\n網を被せて捕まえたんだが、そいつ水みたいになって\n網目を通り抜けて逃げていったらしいんだよ",
      "en": "My guys ran into it on a night patrol once.\nThey netted it, but then\nit turned to water and slipped through to escape."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02387-02388",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Haishera",
      "jp": "（霊体、とはまた違う様だの……）",
      "en": "(It seems different from a spirit, though...)"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02390-02391",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Celica",
      "jp": "それで？",
      "en": "And then?"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02397-02399",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Kaura",
      "jp": "ああ、結局捕まえれなくて追っかけていったら、\n街から少し離れたカドラ廃坑に逃げ込んだって話だ",
      "en": "Yeah, they couldn't catch it so they gave chase.\nIt ran off to Kadra Mine, just outside town."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02401-02402",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Celica",
      "jp": "カドラ廃坑か……",
      "en": "Kadra Mine..."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02420-02421",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Kaura",
      "jp": "廃坑に行くつもりかい？",
      "en": "You're going to the mine?"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02423-02424",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Celica",
      "jp": "仕事だからな",
      "en": "It's work."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02426-02428",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Kaura",
      "jp": "だったら気を付けなよ、彼処は十数年前に\n魔物が出るって言う理由で廃坑になったんだからね",
      "en": "Then be careful. They shut that mine down over ten years ago on account of monsters."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02430-02431",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Celica",
      "jp": "魔物か……",
      "en": "Monsters, huh..."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02433-02435",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Kaura",
      "jp": "ああ、入ってすぐの所は大した奴は居ないらしいけど\n奥の方にはとんでもない化け物が居るって話だよ",
      "en": "Yeah, near the entrance there ain't much to worry about, but deeper in, I hear there's some real nasty monsters."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02437-02438",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Celica",
      "jp": "判った、気を付けよう",
      "en": "Got it. I'll be careful."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02440-02441",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Kaura",
      "jp": "さて、他に何か聞きたい事はあるかい？",
      "en": "Well, anything else you want to ask?"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02443-02444",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Celica",
      "jp": "いや、今は特にない",
      "en": "No, not right now."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02446-02447",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Kaura",
      "jp": "そうかい、じゃあ何か聞きたくなったら此処に来なよ",
      "en": "That so? If you've got questions, just come here."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02449-02450",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Celica",
      "jp": "此処に？",
      "en": "Here?"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:02452-02454",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Kaura",
      "jp": "ああ、この直ぐ近くに自警団が使っている衛兵詰所が\nあってね、あたいは何時もこの辺に居るからさ",
      "en": "Yeah, there's a guard post the watch uses\nright nearby, and I'm always around here."
    }
  ]
}

